Task 3: Customer Churn Prediction

Objective:
Build a machine learning model to predict customer churn using historical customer data.

Description:
This project uses a Random Forest classifier to predict whether a customer will churn or not.
Categorical features are encoded, missing values are handled, and the model performance is
evaluated using accuracy, classification report, and confusion matrix.

Tools & Technologies:
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn

Dataset:
Churn_Modelling.csv

Model Used:
- Random Forest Classifier

Results:
Accuracy: 86%

Status:
Completed
